### Register a new user

POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "jckba",
    "email": "jckba@example.com",
    "password": "jckba123!",
    "firstName": "Jose",
    "lastName": "Cabanillas",
    "primaryCurrencyId": 1
}

